      "kind": "caption",
      "source": {
        "text": "Originally, this character delivered food from a generically named Japanese-style Chinese restaurant. Because the name's significance would've been lost on players outside of Japan, the package was replaced with a generic pizza box for the English release (Game: Tricky Kick)",
