      "kind": "caption",
      "source": {
        "text": "Japanese players are asked to hold the controller like a traditional okappiki. But because most players outside of Japan wouldn't understand this reference, the English version asks players to hold the controller like a boxer instead (Game: WarioWare: Smooth Moves)",
